{% section 'page-hero' %}
<section class="velora-page-content">
  <div class="velora-page-inner">
    <h1>Frequently asked questions</h1>

    <div class="velora-faq-item">
      <h2>What kind of products does Velora offer?</h2>
      <p>Velora offers wellness essentials focused on better sleep, recovery, and daily comfort.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="velora-faq-item">
      <h2>How long does shipping take?</h2>
      <p>Shipping times vary by destination and product. Estimated delivery times will be shown at checkout.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="velora-faq-item">
      <h2>Can I track my order?</h2>
      <p>Yes. Once your order ships, tracking information will be sent by email.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="velora-faq-item">
      <h2>What is your return policy?</h2>
      <p>Returns are accepted according to the conditions in our Returns & Refunds Policy.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .velora-page-content { padding: 72px 24px; background: #f7f5f1; color: #1f2321; }
  .velora-page-inner { max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; gap: 20px; }
  .velora-page-inner h1 { font-size: 2.2rem; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .velora-faq-item { background: #fff; padding: 20px; border-radius: 16px; border: 1px solid rgba(31,35,33,0.08); }
  .velora-faq-item h2 { font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .velora-faq-item p { color: #4b544f; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0; }
</style>
